#! thorn palisade - cut thornbrush lashed between stakes, taller than a man
#! Silhouette carries the read: three hand-cut stakes topping out at different
#! heights, because a palisade nobody measured should not look measured.
#! Thorns angle upward off the stakes in two-pixel spurs at irregular intervals -
#! horizontal ticks at even spacing read as a trellis, which is a fence that
#! invites climbing rather than one that argues against it.
#! Density stays near half the cell. An earlier pass filled the gaps with thorn
#! mass and the stakes inverted into holes; at 16x24 texture must never out-mass
#! its subject.
